+### Self-hosted deployments
+
+A self-hosted deployment can configure default AI credentials by providing the following environment variables. The variables are used as a fallback when the user has not entered an API key in their browser settings. Note that the deployment configuration is never exposed in exportable learner data, and local BYOK settings override these defaults.
+
+- `AI_API_KEY`: API key.
+- `AI_MODEL`: Model ID (e.g. `gpt-4o-mini`).
+- `AI_BASE_URL`: (Optional) Base URL if not using standard OpenAI endpoint.
